Gizmo, a gnome warlock with a mischievous glint in his eye, stalked through the dense foliage of Stranglethorn Vale. His succubus, Lilith, purred softly beside him, her crimson eyes scanning the jungle for danger. A group of trolls lumbered into view, their crude weapons glinting in the dappled sunlight. Gizmo grinned, a wicked spark igniting in his gaze. "Time for a little fun, Lilith," he whispered, and with a flick of his wrist, unleashed a torrent of shadow magic. Lilith, with a seductive smirk, unleashed her own brand of chaos, ensnaring the trolls in a web of seductive illusions.

**Answer:**

Seduction. The succubus's Seduction ability can be used to control enemy mobs, making solo questing and grinding much easier. 


 [end of text]


